(5404, 'products', 'description', 892, 'ru', '<p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; ">КМ-ТкК-Кр &ndash;&nbsp;Кошелек "Монтана" темно-коричневого цвета из кожи краст</span></strong></p>\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">Размер:<span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp; </span>12* 9,7 см.</span></p>\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">Цвет : темно-коричневый</span></p>\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">Застежка : на кнопку</span></p>\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">Вид кожи: натуральная кожа краст</span></p>\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">Вид поверхности: естественная матовая поверхность</span></p>\n<p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast" style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-ansi-language: RU;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">Есть возможность сделать индивидуальное <a href="https://lavoks.com/ru/tisnenie">тиснение</a> &ndash; имя, или инициалы, или памятную дату, или номер авто, сердечки или смайлик.</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;  mso-ansi-language: RU;">Мужской кошелек &laquo;Монтана&raquo;. Самый популярная мужская модель. Внутри одно отделение для бумажных купюр, кармашек</span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; "> для монет, три </span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;  mso-ansi-language: RU;">отделения </span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; ">для </span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;  mso-ansi-language: RU;">пластиковых </span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; ">карт </span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;  mso-ansi-language: RU;">и потайной кармашек.</span></p>', '2019-10-17 16:40:33', '2019-10-17 16:40:33'),
