(5433, 'products', 'description', 895, 'ru', '<p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">Балу -ЧЧ-2 - сумка </span></strong><strong><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">&laquo;</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">Балу</span></strong><strong><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">&raquo;, цвет </span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">ч</span></strong><strong><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">ё</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">рн</span></strong><strong><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">ый, кожа кайзер</span></strong></p>\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">Размер:</span> <span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; ">2</span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;  mso-ansi-language: RU;">0</span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; ">*2</span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;  mso-ansi-language: RU;">0</span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; ">*6 см</span></p>\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-ansi-language: RU;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">Цвет изделия:</span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;"> чёрный</span></p>\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-ansi-language: RU;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">Цвет ремня: в цвет кожи</span></p>\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-ansi-language: RU;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">Вид </span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">кожи: </span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">натуральная </span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">кожа кайзер</span></p>\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-ansi-language: RU;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">Вид поверхности: стойкая поверхность с легким глянцем</span></p>\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-ansi-language: RU;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">Цвет нитки :</span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;"> в цвет кожи</span></p>\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-ansi-language: RU;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">Цвет фурнитуры: никель</span></p>\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-ansi-language: RU;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">Количество карманов: 2 снаружи, 2 внутри</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 45.8pt 91.6pt 137.4pt 183.2pt 229.0pt 274.8pt 320.6pt 366.4pt 412.2pt 458.0pt 503.8pt 549.6pt 595.4pt 641.2pt 687.0pt 732.8pt;"><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: ''Times New Roman''; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; mso-ansi-language: RU; mso-fareast-language: UK;">Сумка мужская "Балу" имеет небольшой размер 20 * 20 * 6 см. Спереди обьёмный карман на молнии, карман сзади на молнии. Внутри 2 кармана -один обычный, второй на молнии. Ременная тесьма матовая, идёт в цвет сумки. </span></p>', '2019-10-26 16:54:04', '2019-10-26 16:54:04'),
