(5446, 'products', 'name', 897, 'ru', 'Поясная сумка "Дизи"', '2019-10-29 18:55:20', '2019-10-29 18:55:20'),
(5447, 'products', 'description', 897, 'ru', '<p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA; mso-ansi-language: RU;">Дизи -SC-Ф - Поясная сумка "Дизи" темно-синего цвета из кожи флотар</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; color: #222222;"><span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';"><span style="font-family: Symbol;">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA;">Р</span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA; mso-ansi-language: RU;">а</span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA;">зм</span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA; mso-ansi-language: RU;">е</span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA;">р: 32 см верх, 22 см низ, глибина зверху - 6,5 см, висота - 17см.</span></li>\n<li><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; color: #222222;"><span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';"><span style="font-family: Symbol;">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA; mso-ansi-language: RU;">Цвет</span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA;">&nbsp;фурнитур</span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA; mso-ansi-language: RU;">ы</span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA;">&nbsp;: никель</span></li>\n<li><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; color: #222222;"><span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';"><span style="font-family: Symbol;">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA; mso-ansi-language: RU;">Цвет кожи</span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA;">: темно-синий</span></li>\n<li><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; color: #222222;"><span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';"><span style="font-family: Symbol;">&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA;">Назва</span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA; mso-ansi-language: RU;">ние</span>&nbsp;<span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA; mso-ansi-language: RU;">кожи&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA;">: натуральна</span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA; mso-ansi-language: RU;">я</span>&nbsp;<span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA; mso-ansi-language: RU;">кожа</span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA;">&nbsp;флотар</span></li>\n<li><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Тип поверхности :&nbsp;</span><span style="color: #222222; font-family: Montserrat; font-size: 11pt;">стойкая, рельефная поверхность &laquo;в зернышко&raquo;, природный блеск</span></li>\n<li><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; color: #222222;"><span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';"><span style="font-family: Symbol;">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA;">Обхват ( min та max)&nbsp;&nbsp;: женск</span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA; mso-ansi-language: RU;">ий</span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA;">&nbsp;70см&nbsp;&nbsp;- 115 см.,&nbsp;</span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA; mso-ansi-language: RU;">мужской</span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA;">&nbsp;92см - 135 см</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA; mso-ansi-language: RU;">Поясная сумка &laquo;Дизи&raquo; довольно немаленького размера. Имеет спереди карман на молнии, сзади карман на молнии. Открывается сумка на молнию, и внутри еще 2 кармана. Все карманы сделаны из тонкой кожи. Самая главная &laquo;фишка&raquo; сумки -застежка ремня на кольцо -карабин. Это очень удобно и довольно красиво и оригинально. При заказе убедительная просьба сказать для мужчины или женщины сумка -длина ремешка отличается.</span></p>', '2019-10-29 18:55:20', '2019-10-29 18:59:28'),
