(5554, 'products', 'description', 906, 'ru', '<p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA;">Р35</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA;">Р-М-6 &ndash; Ремень</span></strong><strong><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA; mso-ansi-language: RU;">&nbsp;шириной 35 мм,</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA;">&nbsp;ременн</span></strong><strong><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA; mso-ansi-language: RU;">ая</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA;">&nbsp;кож</span></strong><strong><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA; mso-ansi-language: RU;">а цвета марсала</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA;">, пряжка № 6</span></strong></p>\n<p><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-ansi-language: RU;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; ">Ширина ремня :&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;  mso-ansi-language: RU;">&nbsp;35<span lang="RU">&nbsp;мм</span></span></p>\n<p><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; color: #222222;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA;">Длина ремня: стандартный 120-125 см. Есть возможность сделать максимальную длину 140-150 см</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; color: #222222;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA;">Размер на заказ: по предоплате делаем длину именно под Вас по нашей схеме&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; color: #222222;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA;">Номер пряжки: 6</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; color: #222222; mso-ansi-language: RU;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA; mso-ansi-language: RU;">Цвет кожи: марсала</span></p>\n<p><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; color: #222222;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA;">Цвет пряжки: никель, лаковая</span></p>\n<p><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; color: #222222;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA;">Вид кожи: натуральная ременная кожа</span></p>\n<p><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; color: #222222;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA;">Толщина кожи: 3,5 - 4 мм&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; color: #222222;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA;">Жесткость: средняя&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; color: #222222;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA;">Вид поверхности: поверхность хорошо отполирована,</span>&nbsp;<span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background: #F8F9FA;">небольшой натуральный глянец</span></p>\n<p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast" style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;"><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-ansi-language: RU;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">Есть возможность сделать индивидуальное <a href="https://lavoks.com/ru/tisnenie">тиснение</a> &ndash; имя, или инициалы, или памятную дату, или номер авто, сердечки или смайлик.</span></p>', '2019-10-30 05:04:33', '2019-10-30 05:04:33'),
