(5608, 'products', 'description', 911, 'ru', '<p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">КлФ</span></strong><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;">s</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">-ЧЧ &ndash; </span></strong><strong><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">Ключница</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;"> &laquo;ФРОГ&raquo;</span></strong><strong><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">, размер </span></strong><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;">s</span></strong><strong><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">, <span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span>кожа</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">&nbsp;напа</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">, </span></strong><strong><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">цвет черный</span></strong></p>\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">Р</span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">а</span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">зм</span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">е</span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">р:</span> <span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; ">10 * 10 см</span></p>\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">Цвет изделия</span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">: черный</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-ansi-language: RU;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">Вид кожи</span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">: </span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">натуральная кожа</span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">&nbsp;наппа</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-ansi-language: RU;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">Вид поверхн</span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">ости</span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">:&nbsp; имеет небольшой естественный глянец, мягкая и приятная на ощупь</span></p>\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-ansi-language: RU;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">Цвет</span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;"> нитки:</span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;"> в цвет кожи </span></p>\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">Заст</span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">ежка</span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">: </span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">плоский пружинный<span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp; </span>механизм</span></p>\n<p><a name="_Hlk23457351"></a><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">Внутри кожаный шнурок с кольцом для ключей</span></p>\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">Есть возможность сделать индивидуальное <a href="https://lavoks.com/ru/tisnenie">тиснение</a> &ndash; имя, или инициалы, или памятную дату, или номер авто, сердечки или смайлик.</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: ''Times New Roman''; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; mso-ansi-language: RU; mso-fareast-language: UK;">Маленькая ключница, которая не займет много места у вас в сумке или кармане и убережет от дырок там. Такой себе кожаный мешочек с застежкой сверху. Застежка открывается при нажатии на кончики пальцами, и резко закрывается когда отпускаете, с характерным звуком, оттуда и название. Застежка - это две металлические полоски, которые пружинят при нажатии. </span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">Внутри кожаный шнурок с кольцом для ключей. </span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: ''Times New Roman''; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; mso-ansi-language: RU; mso-fareast-language: UK;">Очень интересная штучка, даже просто поиграться)</span></p>', '2019-10-31 21:05:09', '2019-10-31 21:06:45'),
