rial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">Цвет</span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">&nbsp;нитки:</span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">&nbsp;в цвет кожи</span></p>\n<p><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span>&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">Заст</span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">ежка</span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">:&nbsp;</span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">плоский пружинный<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>механизм</span></p>\n<p><a style="background-image: url(''img/anchor.gif'');" name="_Hlk23457351"></a><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span>&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">Внутри кожаный шнурок с кольцом для ключей</span></p>\n<p><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span>&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">Есть возможность сделать индивидуальное <a href="https://lavoks.com/ru/tisnenie">тиснение</a> &ndash; имя, или инициалы, или памятную дату, или номер авто, сердечки или смайлик.</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: ''Times New Roman''; mso-