(5636, 'products', 'description', 915, 'ru', '<p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">КлФм</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">-ЧЧ &ndash;&nbsp;</span></strong><strong><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">Ключница</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">&nbsp;&laquo;ФРОГ&raquo;</span></strong><strong><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">, размер M</span></strong><strong><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">,&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;</span>кожа</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">&nbsp;наппа</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">,&nbsp;</span></strong><strong><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">цвет черный</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span>&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">Р</span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">а</span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">зм</span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">е</span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">р:</span>&nbsp;<span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; ">10 * 15 см</span></p>\n<p><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span>&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">Цвет изделия</span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">: черный</span></p>\n<p><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-ansi-language: RU;"><span>&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">Вид кожи</span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">:&nbsp;</span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">натуральная кожа</span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">&nbsp;наппа</span></p>\n<p><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-ansi-language: RU;"><span>&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">Вид поверхн</span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">ости</span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">: имеет небольшой естественный глянец, мягкая и приятная на ощуп</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-ansi-language: RU;"><span>&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">Цвет</span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">&nbsp;нитки:</span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">&nbsp;в цвет кожи</span></p>\n<p><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span>&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">Заст</span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">ежка</span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">:&nbsp;</span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">плоский пружинный<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>механизм</span></p>\n<p><a style="background-image: url(''img/anchor.gif'');" name="_Hlk23457351"></a><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span>&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">Внутри кожаный шнурок с кольцом для ключей</span></p>\n<p><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span>&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">Есть возможность сделать индивидуальное <a href="https://lavoks.com/ru/tisnenie">тиснение</a> &ndash; имя, или инициалы, или памятную дату, или номер авто, сердечки или смайлик.</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: ''Times New Roman''; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; mso-ansi-language: RU; mso-fareast-language: UK;">&nbsp;Ключница для длинных ключей, которая не займет много места у вас в сумке или кармане и убережет от дырок там. Такой себе кожаный мешочек с застежкой сверху. Застежка открывается при нажатии на кончики пальцами, и резко закрывается когда отпускаете, с характерным звуком, оттуда и название. Застежка - это две металлические полоски, которые пружинят при нажатии.&nbsp;</span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">Внутри кожаный шнурок с кольцом для ключей.&nbsp;</span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: ''Times New Roman''; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #222222; mso-ansi-language: RU; mso-fareast-language: UK;">Очень интересная штучка, даже просто поиграться)&nbsp;</span></p>', '2019-10-31 21:56:28', '2019-10-31 21:56:28'),
