&nbsp;<span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">наппа</span></li>\n<li style="box-sizing: border-box;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol;">&middot;<span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Вид поверхн</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">ости</span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">:&nbsp;</span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">м</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">ягкая и приятная на ощупь</span>&nbsp;<span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li style="box-sizing: border-box;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol;">&middot;<span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Цвет</span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;нитки :</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;в цвет кожи</span></li>\n<li style="box-sizing: border-box;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol;">&middot;<span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Заст</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">еж</span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">ка:&nbsp;</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">плоский пружинный&nbsp; механизм</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #020202; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; margin-left: 18pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">М</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">ягкий чехол для очков</span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">, который&nbsp;</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">иногда гораздо удобнее объёмного.&nbsp;</span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;Такой себе кожаный мешочек с застежкой сверху. Застежка открывается при нажатии на кончики пальцами, и резко закрывается когда отпускаете, с характерным звуком, оттуда и название. Застежка-это две металлические полоски, которые пружинят при нажатии.&nbsp;</span></p>', '2020-04-18 20:42:37', '2020-04-18 20:42:37'),
