(6593, 'products', 'description', 1139, 'ru', '<p class="MsoNormal" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #020202; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Montserrat; color: #222222; ">Р</span></span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;"><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Montserrat; color: #222222; ">40</span></span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Montserrat; color: #222222; ">Р-Тк-14 &ndash; Ремень</span></span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;"><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Montserrat; color: #222222; ">&nbsp;шириной 40 мм,</span></span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Montserrat; color: #222222; ">&nbsp;коричневая</span></span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Montserrat; color: #222222; ">&nbsp;ременн</span></span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;"><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Montserrat; color: #222222; ">ая</span></span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Montserrat; color: #222222; ">&nbsp;кож</span></span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;"><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Montserrat; color: #222222; ">а</span></span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Montserrat; color: #222222; ">, пряжка № 14</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #020202; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;"><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Symbol;">&middot;<span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Montserrat; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">Ширина ремня :&nbsp;</span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Montserrat; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;<span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box;">40 мм</span></span></li>\n<li style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #020202; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Symbol; color: #222222;">&middot;<span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Montserrat; color: #222222; ">Длина ремня: стандартный 120-125 см. Есть возможность сделать максимальную длину 140-150 см</span>&nbsp;</li>\n<li style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #020202; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Symbol; color: #222222;">&middot;<span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Montserrat; color: #222222; ">Размер на заказ: по предоплате делаем длину именно под Вас по нашей схеме&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</li>\n<li style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #020202; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Symbol; color: #222222;">&middot;<span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Montserrat; color: #222222; ">Номер пряжки: 14</span>&nbsp;</li>\n<li style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #020202; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;"><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Symbol; color: #222222;">&middot;<span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Montserrat; color: #222222; ">Цвет кожи: коричневій</span></li>\n<li style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #020202; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Symbol; color: #222222;">&middot;<span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Montserrat; color: #222222; ">Цвет пряжки: титан, матовая</span></li>\n<li style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #020202; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Symbol; color: #222222;">&middot;<span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Montserrat; color: #222222; ">Вид кожи: натуральная ременная кожа</span></li>\n<li style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #020202; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Symbol; color: #222222;">&middot;<span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Montserrat; color: #222222; ">Толщина кожи: 3,5 - 4 мм&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</li>\n<li style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #020202; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Symbol; color: #222222;">&middot;<span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Montserrat; color: #222222; ">Жесткость: средняя&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</li>\n<li style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #020202; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Symbol; color: #222222;">&middot;<span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Montserrat; color: #222222; ">Вид поверхности: поверхность хорошо отполирована,</span>&nbsp;<span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Montserrat; color: #222222; ">небольшой натуральный глянец</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #020202; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; text-indent: -18pt;"><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Symbol;">&middot;<span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Montserrat;">Есть возможность сделать индивидуальное <a href="https://lavoks.com/ru/tisnenie">тиснение</a> &ndash; имя, или инициалы, или памятную дату, или номер авто, сердечки или смайлик.</span></p>', '2020-04-24 04:14:44', '2020-04-24 04:14:44'),
