fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-ansi-language: RU;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang="RU" style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: ''Arial'',sans-serif; mso-ansi-language: RU;">Количество карманов: 1 внутри</span></li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast" style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang="RU" style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-ansi-language: RU;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang="RU" style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: ''Arial'',sans-serif; mso-ansi-language: RU;">Застежка : сумка закрывается на молнию</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: ''Arial'',sans-serif; "><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span>Сумка "</span><span lang="RU" style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: ''Arial'',sans-serif;  mso-ansi-language: RU;">Окси </span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: ''Arial'',sans-serif; ">"</span><span lang="RU" style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: ''Arial'',sans-serif;  mso-ansi-language: RU;"> среднего размера. </span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: ''Arial'',sans-serif; ">Удобно носить на плече</span><span lang="RU" style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: ''Arial'',sans-serif;  mso-ansi-language: RU;"> или как &laquo;</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: ''Arial'',sans-serif;  mso-ansi-language: EN-US;">crossbody</span><sp