(6720, 'products', 'description', 1192, 'ru', '<p class="MsoNormal" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #020202; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;"><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">КхБ-Кр-2 - картхолдер </span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&laquo;</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Картбук&raquo; красный из кожи кайзер</span></span></p>\n<ul style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; list-style: none; padding-left: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: #020202; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;">\n<li style="box-sizing: border-box;"><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Symbol;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box;">&middot;<span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Р</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">а</span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">зм</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">е</span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">р:</span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;<span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">7&nbsp;</span></span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">см</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">* 10,5 см&nbsp;</span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">в&nbsp;</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">сложенном виде</span></li>\n<li style="box-sizing: border-box;"><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Symbol;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box;">&middot;<span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Цвет изделия: красный</span></li>\n<li style="box-sizing: border-box;"><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Symbol;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box;">&middot;<span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Размер файлика: под визитки или под карточки</span></li>\n<li style="box-sizing: border-box;"><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Symbol;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box;">&middot;<span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Карманы в файлике: 16 штук</span></li>\n<li style="box-sizing: border-box;"><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Symbol;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box;">&middot;<span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Вид кожи</span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">:&nbsp;</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">натуральная кожа</span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;кайзер</span></li>\n<li style="box-sizing: border-box;"><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Symbol;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box;">&middot;<span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Вид поверхн</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">ости</span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">: стойкая поверхность с легким глянцем</span></li>\n<li style="box-sizing: border-box;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Symbol;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box;">&middot;<span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Цвет</span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;нитки:</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;в цвет кожи</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #020202; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; text-indent: -18pt;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Symbol;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box;">&middot;<span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Т</span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">иснение:</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;возможность</span>&nbsp;<span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">сделать</span>&nbsp;<span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">и</span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">ндивидуальн</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">ое</span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;<a href="https://lavoks.com/ru/tisnenie">тиснен</a></span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">ие</span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;&ndash; ім`я, або ініціали, або пам`ятну дату, чи номер автомобіля, сердечко або смайлик.</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #020202; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;"><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">В к</span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">артхолдер</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;&laquo;Картбук&raquo;</span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">,&nbsp;</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">свободно</span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;входят&nbsp;</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">16</span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;карто</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">чек в файлики и еще по 2-3 карты в боковые карманы самой обложки. То есть, в эту маленькую книжечку можно поместить минимум 20 карточек или визиток.</span></p>', '2020-05-19 23:16:33', '2020-05-19 23:16:33'),
