family: ''Times New Roman''; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #020202; mso-ansi-language: RU; mso-fareast-language: UK;">&middot;</span><span lang="RU" style="font-size: 7.0pt; font-family: ''Times New Roman'',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: ''Times New Roman''; color: #020202; mso-ansi-language: RU; mso-fareast-language: UK;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: ''Arial'',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: ''Times New Roman''; color: #020202; mso-fareast-language: UK;">Вид поверхности:&nbsp;</span><span lang="RU" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: ''Arial'',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: ''Times New Roman''; color: #020202; mso-ansi-language: RU; mso-fareast-language: UK;">слегка глянцевая, стойкая поверхность</span></li>\n<li class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal;"><span lang="RU" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: ''Times New Roman''; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #020202; mso-ansi-language: RU; mso-fareast-language: UK;">&middot;</span><span lang="RU" style="font-size: 7.0pt; font-family: ''Times New Roman'',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: ''Times New Roman''; color: #020202; mso-ansi-language: RU; mso-fareast-language: UK;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: ''Arial'',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: ''Times New Roman''; color: #020202; mso-fareast-language: UK;">Цвет нитки:</span><span lang="RU" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: ''Arial'',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: ''Times New Roman''; color: #020202; mso-ansi-language: RU; mso-fareast-language: UK;">&nbsp;в цвет кожи</span></li>\n<li class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal;"><span lang="RU" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: ''Times New Roman''; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #020202; mso-ansi-language: RU; mso-fareast-language: UK;">&middot;</span><span lang="RU" style="font-size: 7.0pt; font-family: ''Times New Roman'',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: ''Times New Roman''; color: #020202; mso-ansi-language: RU; mso-fareast-language: UK;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang="RU" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: ''Arial'',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: ''Times New Roman''; color: #020202; mso-ansi-language: RU; mso-fareast-language: UK;">Количество карманов: 2 внутри и 2 снаружи</span></li>\n<li class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal;"><span lang="RU" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: ''Times New Roman''; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #020202; mso-ansi-language: RU; mso-fareast-language: UK;">&middot;</span><span lang="RU" style="font-size: 7.0pt; font-family: ''Times New Roman'',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: ''Times New Roman''; color: #020202; mso-ansi-language: RU; mso-fareast-language: UK;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang="RU" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: ''Arial'',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: ''Times New Roman''; color: #020202; mso-ansi-language: RU; mso-fareast-language: UK;">Застежка: сумка закрывается на молнию</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: ''Times New Roman'',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: ''Times New Roman''; mso-fareast-language: UK;"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp; </span></span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: ''Arial'',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: ''Times New Roman''; color: #020202;  mso-fareast-language: UK;">Сумка "</span><span lang="RU" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: ''Arial'',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: ''Times New Roman''; color: #020202;  mso-ansi-language: RU; mso-fareast-language: UK;">Линда&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: ''Arial'',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: ''Times New Roman''; color: #020202;  mso-fareast-language: UK;">"</span><span lang="RU" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: ''Arial'',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: ''Times New Roman''; color: #020202;  mso-ansi-language: RU; mso-fareast-language: UK;">&nbsp;среднего размера.&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: ''Arial'',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: ''Times New Roman''; color: #020202;  mso-fareast-language: UK;">Удобно носить на плече</span><span lang="RU" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: ''Arial'',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: ''Times New Roman''; color: #020202;  mso-ansi-language: RU; mso-fareast-language: UK;">&nbsp;или как &laquo;</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: ''Arial'',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: ''Times New Roman''; color: #020202;  mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: UK;">crossbody</span><span lang="RU" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: ''Arial'',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: ''Times New Roman''; color: #020202;  mso-ansi-language: RU; mso-fareast-language: UK;">&raquo;. У сумки 4 кармана -два снаружи (один спереди и один сзади на молнии), и внутри 2 больших кармана. Сумка застегивается на молнию, и сверху крышка на магните. Очень вместительная сумка, полностью из натуральной кожи. Без подкладки.</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: ''Arial'',sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>', '2020-06-16 03:24:43', '2020-06-16 03:31:15'),
