;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Цвет изделия: марсала</span></li>\n<li class="MsoNormal" style="box-sizing: border-box; line-height: normal;"><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Symbol;">&middot;</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 7pt; font-family: ''Times New Roman'', serif;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Цвет фурнитуры: антик</span></li>\n<li class="MsoNormal" style="box-sizing: border-box; line-height: normal;"><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Symbol;">&middot;</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 7pt; font-family: ''Times New Roman'', serif;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Вид&nbsp;</span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">кожи:&nbsp;</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">натуральная&nbsp;</span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">кожа&nbsp;</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">кайзер</span></li>\n<li class="MsoNormal" style="box-sizing: border-box; line-height: normal;"><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Symbol;">&middot;</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 7pt; font-family: ''Times New Roman'', serif;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Вид поверхности:&nbsp;</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">слегка глянцевая, стойкая поверхность</span></li>\n<li class="MsoNormal" style="box-sizing: border-box; line-height: normal;"><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Symbol;">&middot;</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 7pt; font-family: ''Times New Roman'', serif;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Цвет нитки:</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;в цвет кожи</span></li>\n<li class="MsoNormal" style="box-sizing: border-box; line-height: normal;"><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Symbol;">&middot;</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 7pt; font-family: ''Times New Roman'', serif;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Количество карманов: 2 внутри и 2 снаружи</span></li>\n<li class="MsoNormal" style="box-sizing: border-box; line-height: normal;"><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Symbol;">&middot;</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 7pt; font-family: ''Times New Roman'', serif;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Застежка: сумка закрывается на молнию</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; color: #020202; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; line-height: normal;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: ''Times New Roman'', serif;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box;">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">Сумка "</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">Линда&nbsp;</span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">"</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;среднего размера.&nbsp;</span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">Удобно носить на плече</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;или как &laquo;</span><span lang="EN-US" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">crossbody</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&raquo;. У сумки 4 кармана -два снаружи (один спереди и один сзади на молнии), и внутри 2 больших кармана. Сумка застегивается на молнию, и сверху крышка на магните. Очень вместительная сумка, полностью из натуральной кожи. Без подкладки.</span></p>', '2020-06-25 03:40:36', '2020-06-25 03:40:36'),
