der-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Symbol;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box;">&middot;<span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Цвет изделия: светло-бежевый</span></li>\n<li style="box-sizing: border-box;"><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Symbol;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box;">&middot;<span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Цвет фурнитуры: никель</span></li>\n<li style="box-sizing: border-box;"><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Symbol;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box;">&middot;<span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Вид&nbsp;</span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">кожи:&nbsp;</span><span lang="RU" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">натуральная&nbsp;</span><span style="box-sizin